{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41680","headline":"锺陵道中作 · 陈陶","name":"锺陵道中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"原隰经霜蕙草黄，塞鸿消息怨流芳。\n秋山落照见麋鹿，南国异花开雪霜。\n烟火近通盘瓠俗，水云深入武陵乡。\n曾逢啮缺话东海，长忆萧家青玉牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}